# Agreement and Consultation Dates

This scope computes the start date of consultations, the effective date of the agreement, and the fixed expiry date.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementAndConsultations:
  input request_date content date
  input signature_date content date
  output consultation_start_date content date
  output effective_date content date
  output expiry_date content date
```

## Consultation start date

Consultations must begin within one month from the date of the request.

```catala
scope AgreementAndConsultations:
  date round down
  definition consultation_start_date equals
    request_date + 1 month
```

## Agreement entry into force

The agreement enters into force on the day of its signature.

```catala
scope AgreementAndConsultations:
  definition effective_date equals signature_date
```

## Agreement expiry date

The agreement is applicable until 31 December 2006.

```catala
scope AgreementAndConsultations:
  definition expiry_date equals |2006-12-31|
```